            },
            "reviewBody": "The batter was a bit bland so I added lemon pepper panko bread crumbs to it and used Mickeys ale for the beer. I was able to also use veggies like potatoes and zucchinis. However, I ended up with too much batter.",
            "datePublished": "2019-06-04T02:26:24.130Z"
